Regarding the drift rate (TRUE) and (FALSE), visual inspections of the predictions show that, as car recognition ability increases, both drift rate (TRUE and FALSE) for both stimuli conditions (Learned and Novel) increases as well. In summary, as car recognition ability increases, the accumulation of signal (drift rate TRUE) and the accumulation of noise (FALSE) increase, regardless of the stimulus condition (@fig-prediction-drift-car). 




